{"numsheets":12,"currentid":"sheet1","currentname":"sheet1","sheetArr":{"sheet1":{"sheetstr":{"savestr":"version:1.5\ncell:B3:t:HELP:b::2:2::l:1:f:1:c:3:bg:1:cf:1:colspan:8\ncell:B5:t:The Ledger project comprising of 135+ ledger entries is for maintaining Ledger statements of your enterprise for accounting, budgeting, valuation and personal use.:colspan:8\ncell:B7:t:The Test sheet is an example Ledger to understand the Business Ledger application. The user can also remove the sample values individually by clicking on cross button, and can maintain it as a separate Ledger for outside business activities simultaneously.   :colspan:8\ncell:B9:t:Explanation of tables in Ledger sheets (1-10).:colspan:8\ncell:B11:t:Table Name:b:2:2:2:2:c:3:bg:1:cf:1:colspan:2\ncell:C11:b:2:2:2:2\ncell:D11:t:Description:b:2:2:2:2:c:3:bg:1:cf:1:colspan:6\ncell:A12:b::1::\ncell:B12:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:D12:b::1::1:colspan:6\ncell:I12:b::1::\ncell:A13:b::1::\ncell:B13:t:Customer/ Payee:b::1::1:bg:2:cf:1:colspan:2\ncell:C13:bg:2\ncell:D13:t:Customer represents the name of the customer or business; Payee represents the name of the person or business.:b::1::1:bg:2:colspan:6\ncell:A14:b::1::\ncell:B14:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:D14:b::1::1:colspan:6\ncell:A15:b::1::\ncell:B15:t:Check #/Invoice:b::1::1:bg:2:cf:1:colspan:2\ncell:C15:bg:2\ncell:D15:t:Check # represents the check number for the transaction; Invoice represents the invoice associated with the transaction.:b::1::1:bg:2:colspan:6\ncell:A16:b::1::\ncell:B16:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:D16:b::1::1:colspan:6\ncell:A17:b::1::\ncell:B17:t:Memo/ Description:b::1::1:bg:2:cf:1:colspan:2\ncell:C17:bg:2\ncell:D17:t:Transaction notes.:b::1::1:bg:2:colspan:6\ncell:A18:b::1::\ncell:B18:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:D18:b::1::1:colspan:6\ncell:A19:b::1::\ncell:B19:t:Category:b::1::1:bg:2:cf:1:colspan:2\ncell:C19:bg:2\ncell:D19:t:The category for the item.:b::1::1:bg:2:colspan:6\ncell:A20:b::1::\ncell:B20:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:D20:b::1::1:colspan:6\ncell:A21:b::1::\ncell:B21:t:Due Date:b::1::1:bg:2:cf:1:colspan:2\ncell:C21:bg:2\ncell:D21:t:The date when payment is due.:b::1::1:bg:2:colspan:6\ncell:A22:b::1::\ncell:B22:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:D22:b::1::1:colspan:6\ncell:A23:b::1::\ncell:B23:t:Date Paid:b::1::1:bg:2:cf:1:colspan:2\ncell:C23:bg:2\ncell:D23:t:The date the payment was received.:b::1::1:bg:2:colspan:6\ncell:A24:b::1::\ncell:B24:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:D24:b::1::1:colspan:6\ncell:A25:b::1::\ncell:B25:t:Priority/ Mailed:b::1::1:bg:2:cf:1:colspan:2\ncell:C25:bg:2\ncell:D25:t:Priority represents the priority for the item; Mailed represents whether or not the item has been paid.:b::1::1:bg:2:colspan:6\ncell:A26:b::1::\ncell:B26:b::1::1:cf:1:colspan:2\ncell:C26:cf:1\ncell:D26:b::1::1:colspan:6\ncell:J26:b::::1\ncell:A27:b::1::\ncell:B27:t:Withdrawal, Payment:b::1::1:bg:2:cf:1:colspan:2\ncell:C27:bg:2:cf:1\ncell:D27:t:The amount withdrawn from the account.:b::1::1:bg:2:colspan:6\ncell:J27:b::::1\ncell:A28:b::1::\ncell:B28:b::1::1:cf:1:colspan:2\ncell:C28:cf:1\ncell:D28:b::1::1:colspan:6\ncell:J28:b::::1\ncell:A29:b::1::\ncell:B29:t:Deposit, Credit:b::1::1:bg:2:cf:1:colspan:2\ncell:C29:bg:2:cf:1\ncell:D29:t:The amount deposited to the account.:b::1::1:bg:2:colspan:6\ncell:J29:b::::1\ncell:A30:b::1::\ncell:B30:b::1::1:cf:1:colspan:2\ncell:C30:cf:1\ncell:D30:b::1::1:colspan:6\ncell:J30:b::::1\ncell:A31:b::1::\ncell:B31:t:Balance:b::1:1:1:bg:2:cf:1:colspan:2\ncell:C31:b:::1::bg:2:cf:1\ncell:D31:t:The account balance after the transaction. :b::1:1:1:bg:2:colspan:6\ncell:J31:b::::1\ncell:B32:b:1::::cf:1\ncell:C32:b:1::::cf:1\ncell:D32:b:1:::\ncell:E32:b:1:::\ncell:F32:b:1:::\ncell:G32:b:1:::\ncell:H32:b:1:::\ncell:I32:b:1:::\ncell:B34:t:The final Balance from Ledger i sheet gets automatically borrowed to the Balance of the first entry of Ledger i+1 sheet. Here, i varies from 1-9 for Ledger 1 to Ledger 10 sheets. Similarly, Business Name, Account Name and Account Number should be entered only once in Ledger 1 sheet. The corresponding values get automatically populated in all the other Ledger sheets.:colspan:8\ncell:B36:t:If you need further assistance in using the Business Ledger application, or would like to see some new features in the future versions of the application, please write to us at marketing@tickervalue.com. You can also meet us on Skype by sending a contact request to aspiring.investments.:bg:2:cf:2:colspan:8\ncol:A:w:27\ncol:B:w:55\ncol:C:w:70\ncol:D:w:115\ncol:E:w:103\ncol:F:w:104\ncol:G:w:93\ncol:H:w:79\ncol:I:w:302\nsheet:c:10:r:36\nborder:1:1px solid rgb(0,0,0)\nborder:2:1px solid rgb(255, 255, 255)\ncellformat:1:center\ncellformat:2:left\ncolor:1:rgb(119,136,221)\ncolor:2:rgb(230,230,250)\ncolor:3:rgb(255, 255, 255)\nfont:1:normal normal 14pt Arial\nlayout:1:padding:4px 8px 4px *;vertical-align:bottom;\n"},"name":"sheet1","hidden":"0"},"sheet2":{"sheetstr":{"savestr":"version:1.5\ncell:B2:t:BUSINESS LEDGER:b::3:3::l:7:f:6:c:4:bg:2:cf:1:colspan:10\ncell:B4:t:Business Name:b:2:2:2:2:l:4:f:5:c:1:cf:1\ncell:C4:b:2:2:2:2:l:4:f:5:c:1:cf:1:colspan:3\ncell:D4:l:6:f:1:c:4:cf:1\ncell:E4:l:6:f:2:c:4:cf:2:ntvf:2\ncell:F4:l:6:f:2:c:4:cf:1:ntvf:2\ncell:G4:l:6:f:2:c:4:cf:2:tvf:5:ntvf:2\ncell:H4:l:6:f:2:c:4:cf:2:ntvf:2:rowspan:3\ncell:I4:rowspan:3\ncell:B5:t:Account Name:b:2:2:2:2:l:4:f:5:c:1:bg:3:cf:1\ncell:C5:b:2:2:2:2:l:4:f:5:c:1:bg:3:cf:1:colspan:3\ncell:D5:l:6:f:1:c:4:cf:1\ncell:E5:l:6:f:2:c:4:cf:2:ntvf:2\ncell:F5:l:6:f:2:c:4:cf:1:ntvf:2\ncell:G5:l:6:f:2:c:4:cf:2:ntvf:2\ncell:H5:l:6:f:2:c:4:cf:2:ntvf:2\ncell:B6:t:Account Number:b:2:2:2:2:l:4:f:5:c:1:cf:1\ncell:C6:b:2:2:2:2:l:4:f:5:c:1:cf:1:ntvf:1:colspan:3\ncell:D6:l:6:f:1:c:4:cf:1\ncell:E6:l:6:f:2:c:4:cf:1:ntvf:2\ncell:F6:l:6:f:2:c:4:cf:1:ntvf:2\ncell:G6:l:6:f:2:c:4:cf:1:ntvf:2\ncell:H6:l:6:f:2:c:4:cf:1:ntvf:2\ncell:B7:l:1:f:4\ncell:C7:l:1:f:4\ncell:D7:l:1:f:4\ncell:E7:l:1:f:4\ncell:F7:l:1:f:4\ncell:G7:l:1:f:4\ncell:H7:l:1:f:4\ncell:B8:t:Customer/ Payee:b:3:3:3:3:l:5:f:5:c:4:bg:2:cf:1\ncell:C8:t:Check # / Invoice:b:3:3:3:3:l